  "text": "Necromancy Base\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Necromancy preset \n​\n​\n\nRotation\nPrebuild\n →  + start fight →  →  →  / \n​\nNote: Use  if Hammer does not use it in the prebuild. You should be using  /  at 4.8s on the timer.\n​\nPhase 1\n  →  →   →  →   → \n​\nNote: Skip  if it would put you behind for .\n​\nPhase 2\n →  →  →  ( →  ) →  →  →  →  → \n​\nNote: Use  only if it does not put you behind for .\n​\nPhase 3\n +  →  →  →  →  →  →   ( →  ) →  →  +  to lure \n​\nNote: Use  only if phase timing allows.\n​\nLure\n +  →  →  →  →  →   →  →  →  ( →  )\n​\nNote: Replace   with  if sufficient  stacks.\n​\nLast Pillar and Zaros\n →  ( →  ) →    ( →  ) →   → \n​\nNote: Use  first if your   is still on cooldown.\n​\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kills\n\n09-2023 - Miss Kay Z - Base\n​11-2023 - Jedy - Base\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNex, Angel of Death\n\nThis guide is made and upkept in collaboration with the Nex, Angel of Death discord.\n\nFor those interested in a non-toxic and friendly environment for ‘Small’ team AoD, with team sizes varying from 4 to 7. We accept all experience levels, from Learners to Experts and Teachers. We offer teams running throughout the day.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFormatting Maintained by: @swimmingfish\n      \n    ",
